  "headline": "God of War analysis: Grief as propulsion",
  "description": "A thematic essay on God of War, organized around: Grief as propulsion.",
  "articleBody": "Reading God of War through Grief as propulsion clarifies what the story consistently protects, and what it is willing to break.\n\nThis is an evergreen structural note, centered on motifs and repeated constructions rather than plot-by-plot recap.\n\n1. Motifs: what repeats, and how its meaning shifts over time.\n\n2. Tensions: where value systems collide and why it matters.\n\n3. Aftertaste: how endings shape the theme’s final form.",
